---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<html lang="zh-TW">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={`About | ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="About Liz Chen" />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main class="container">
			<div class="about">
				<img
					src="/avatar.png"
					alt="Liz Chen"
					class="avatar"
				/>
				<div class="bio">
					<p>哈囉，我叫 Liz Chen，因為喜歡貝果所以命名為 Bagel Note。這裡會記錄一些我的讀書觀影心得，跟日常瑣事等等。如果需要聯繫或說笑話，可以發電子郵件給我：<a href="mailto:hi@lizchen.co">hi@lizchen.co</a></p>
					<p class="links">
						<a href="https://mastodon.social/@summer___ends" target="_blank">Mastodon</a>
						<span class="sep">|</span>
						<a href="https://letterboxd.com/lizchen/" target="_blank">Letterboxd</a>
						<span class="sep">|</span>
						<a href="https://www.serializd.com/user/lizchen/profile" target="_blank">Serialized</a>
						<span class="sep">|</span>
						<a href="https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/3888211-liz-chen" target="_blank">GoodReads</a>
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>

			<hr class="divider" />

			<section class="favorites">
				<h2>我喜歡的部落格</h2>
				<ul>
					<li><a href="https://muan.co/" target="_blank">Mu-An Chiou</a></li>
					<li><a href="https://neal.fun/" target="_blank">Neal.Fun</a></li>
					<li><a href="https://craigmod.com/" target="_blank">Craig Mod</a></li>
					<li><a href="http://www.pampamliu.com/" target="_blank">Pam Pam Liu</a></li>
					<li><a href="https://murmuring.idv.tw/" target="_blank">Murmuring - 主婦的碎念日常</a></li>
					<li><a href="https://zeals75.com/" target="_blank">熱情先決 - 徐仲威</a></li>
					<li><a href="https://bugtender.com/" target="_blank">Bugtender</a></li>
				</ul>

				<h2>我喜歡的卡通人物</h2>
				<img
					class="cartoon-img"
					src="/little-my.jpg"
					alt="Little My"
				/>
				<ul>
					<li>Moomin Valley 裡的每個角色，尤其是 <a href="https://moomin.fandom.com/wiki/Little_My" target="_blank">Little My</a></li>
					<li>大耳朵 <a href="https://ultimatepopculture.fandom.com/wiki/Cheburashka" target="_blank">Cheburashka</a></li>
				</ul>

				<h2>我常去的咖啡店</h2>
				<ul>
					<li><a href="https://www.instagram.com/sangthoo.workshop/" target="_blank">鬆土</a></li>
					<li>咖啡梅</li>
					<li>早秋咖啡</li>
					<li>Homey's</li>
					<li>小米酒咖啡店</li>
				</ul>
			</section>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>

<style>
	main {
		padding-top: 2rem;
		padding-bottom: 3rem;
	}
	.about {
		display: flex;
		gap: 2.5rem;
		align-items: flex-start;
	}
	.avatar {
		width: 200px;
		flex-shrink: 0;
	}
	.bio {
		padding-top: 0.25rem;
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		line-height: 1.75;
	}
	.bio p {
		margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
	}
	.links {
		color: var(--fg-muted);
		font-size: 0.875rem;
	}
	.links a {
		color: var(--fg);
	}
	.sep {
		margin: 0 0.4rem;
		color: var(--border);
	}
	.divider {
		margin: 2.5rem 0;
	}
	.favorites h2 {
		font-size: 0.875rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		color: var(--fg-muted);
		margin: 2rem 0 0.5rem 0;
	}
	.favorites h2:first-child {
		margin-top: 0;
	}
	.favorites ul {
		line-height: 2;
	}
	.cartoon-img {
		max-width: 360px;
		margin: 1rem 0;
	}

	@media (max-width: 580px) {
		.about {
			flex-direction: column;
			gap: 1.5rem;
		}
		.avatar {
			width: 100%;
		}
	}
</style>
